(4501498, 648232, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very nice afternoon/morning light and good exposure. I think it would have been somewhat stronger if you had cropped the image past the dominant tree on the left side, focusing more on the path and the bridge. Maybe also a bit from the top to eliminate the hanging branch. (Cool that it would have also worked well for the Leading Lines challenge.)</td>', 'Very nice afternoon/morning light and good exposure. I think it would have been somewhat stronger if you had cropped the image past the dominant tree on the left side, focusing more on the path and the bridge. Maybe also a bit from the top to eliminate the hanging branch. (Cool that it would have also worked well for the Leading Lines challenge.)', '2008-02-20 15:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501500, 647210, 76430, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch for the challenge, but I love the picture.</td>', 'It''s a stretch for the challenge, but I love the picture.', '2008-02-20 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501527, 649048, 89333, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and good composition. I think the exposure is a touch hot on the white hand, especially above the first knuckle. Also, the background dividing line is just a touch off  of being right between the hands.</td>', 'Very cool idea and good composition. I think the exposure is a touch hot on the white hand, especially above the first knuckle. Also, the background dividing line is just a touch off  of being right between the hands.', '2008-02-20 15:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4501534, 648907, 89479, '<td valign="top">Like: Unique approach, extremely good detail in the sunset and background.<br/>Dislike: Hands bug me, I think it would have been much more powerful without them holding up the sign. And im not sure how much control you have over your flash but a more powerful lighting in the foreground would have helped. <br/>Overall good image.<br/>7</td>', 'Like: Unique approach, extremely good detail in the sunset and background.Dislike: Hands bug me, I think it would have been much more powerful without them holding up the sign. And im not sure how much control you have over your flash but a more powerful lighting in the foreground would have helped. Overall good image.7', '2008-02-20 15:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
