(4503072, 648673, 35334, '<td valign="top">I like the withering of the flowers but I''m having some trouble with the composition. My eye keeps being drawn away from the main group to the partial flower on the right. I think it would be stronger without it.</td>', 'I like the withering of the flowers but I''m having some trouble with the composition. My eye keeps being drawn away from the main group to the partial flower on the right. I think it would be stronger without it.', '2008-02-20 23:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
