(4503094, 648907, 35334, '<td valign="top">It is a nice sunset with dramatic clouds. Is your subject supposed to be doing yoga? I guess that from the hands but very little else supports that idea. Her clothing (including the bare shoulder) and posture make me think she''s just paused for a moment to look at the sunset. Your fill light makes the scene look very unnatural (her back should be dark if the scene is lit by the sunset) and even with the fill light her head blends in with the grass in the background.</td>', 'It is a nice sunset with dramatic clouds. Is your subject supposed to be doing yoga? I guess that from the hands but very little else supports that idea. Her clothing (including the bare shoulder) and posture make me think she''s just paused for a moment to look at the sunset. Your fill light makes the scene look very unnatural (her back should be dark if the scene is lit by the sunset) and even with the fill light her head blends in with the grass in the background.', '2008-02-20 23:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503097, 648756, 35334, '<td valign="top">fine</td>', 'fine', '2008-02-20 23:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503103, 649044, 35334, '<td valign="top">I got it instantly. My wife watches TV with headphones because I can''t stand listening to the sound. But image of TV sets in garbage cans do not evoke much of a feeling of peace in me.</td>', 'I got it instantly. My wife watches TV with headphones because I can''t stand listening to the sound. But image of TV sets in garbage cans do not evoke much of a feeling of peace in me.', '2008-02-21 00:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503105, 648617, 35334, '<td valign="top">Very Nice. It looks like a very quiet and peaceful community.</td>', 'Very Nice. It looks like a very quiet and peaceful community.', '2008-02-21 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503116, 648890, 35334, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I see this as a symbol of war. Betsy Ross made the first flag to fly on a fort to inspire soldiers in battle. My other strong association to the American flag is the memory of the one draped over my father''s casket when he was buried in Arlington National Cemetery.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I see this as a symbol of war. Betsy Ross made the first flag to fly on a fort to inspire soldiers in battle. My other strong association to the American flag is the memory of the one draped over my father''s casket when he was buried in Arlington National Cemetery.', '2008-02-21 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4503129, 648882, 35334, '<td valign="top">I like the image. It is a bit mysterious. What are the pipes? What do they have to do with the figure at the right? Maybe if I knew more about "he ping" I would understand the connection to peace.</td>', 'I like the image. It is a bit mysterious. What are the pipes? What do they have to do with the figure at the right? Maybe if I knew more about "he ping" I would understand the connection to peace.', '2008-02-21 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
