(4505180, 648727, 35334, '<td valign="top">I wish you had take this without flash. It would give a better sense of the quiet approach of evening. The big white blob on the lower left distracts me from looking at the reflections in the peaceful creek.</td>', 'I wish you had take this without flash. It would give a better sense of the quiet approach of evening. The big white blob on the lower left distracts me from looking at the reflections in the peaceful creek.', '2008-02-21 17:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
