(4505227, 647943, 42495, '<td valign="top">I give you a lot of credit for entering such a dark shot.  You''re probably getting a low score (hopefully not!) and comments about it being too dark, and yet it fits this photo just right.  This is subtlety done right.</td>', 'I give you a lot of credit for entering such a dark shot.  You''re probably getting a low score (hopefully not!) and comments about it being too dark, and yet it fits this photo just right.  This is subtlety done right.', '2008-02-21 17:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
