(4505237, 649004, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a super title for this lovely photo!  This is incredibly calming. 8<br/> <br/>Edit - repeated viewing and I like it even more - bumping.</td>', 'What a super title for this lovely photo!  This is incredibly calming. 8 Edit - repeated viewing and I like it even more - bumping.', '2008-02-21 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4505238, 648487, 67258, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2008-02-21 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4505247, 648945, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a potentially very powerful image. I like the way you are expressing the idea that some may see suicide as a way to achieve peace.<br/> <br/>My first impression was that the woman had succeeded and had fallen to the floor, spilling the pills as she went down. But her eyes are open and it''s very unlikely that the pills would have landed on top of her. It would have been better for her to have her eyes closed and the pills spilling out of the bottle onto the floor.<br/> <br/>Another possibility is that she has fallen woozy to the floor and is trying to find take more pills to finish herself off. I''m not sure how you could reinforce that interpretation.<br/> <br/>I like the lighting (except for the hot spot on the lower left). I probably would have cropped off the empty tiles at the top and added more of the body at the bottom.</td>', 'This is a potentially very powerful image. I like the way you are expressing the idea that some may see suicide as a way to achieve peace. My first impression was that the woman had succeeded and had fallen to the floor, spilling the pills as she went down. But her eyes are open and it''s very unlikely that the pills would have landed on top of her. It would have been better for her to have her eyes closed and the pills spilling out of the bottle onto the floor. Another possibility is that she has fallen woozy to the floor and is trying to find take more pills to finish herself off. I''m not sure how you could reinforce that interpretation. I like the lighting (except for the hot spot on the lower left). I probably would have cropped off the empty tiles at the top and added more of the body at the bottom.', '2008-02-21 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4505251, 648985, 35334, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The appropriate words make this rise above most of the other cemetery shots.</td>', 'Very nice! The appropriate words make this rise above most of the other cemetery shots.', '2008-02-21 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
