(4505653, 648409, 35334, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you find peace here but what about the neighbors who have to listen to you practice?  ;-)  I''ll accept that this represents peace to you but it is not what I think of when I see this image.<br/> <br/>I like the bold, graphic quality of the image. It might be improved by moving further from the wall so the shadow would not be visible. Darker pants would also keep them from being blown out.</td>', 'I''m sure you find peace here but what about the neighbors who have to listen to you practice?  ;-)  I''ll accept that this represents peace to you but it is not what I think of when I see this image. I like the bold, graphic quality of the image. It might be improved by moving further from the wall so the shadow would not be visible. Darker pants would also keep them from being blown out.', '2008-02-21 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
