(4506622, 648010, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting tree and I like the starburst effect from the sun peeking around it.  I might like a different angle better (like wide angle from the base of the tree), although I don''t know that it would better illustrate the challenge concept.</td>', 'Interesting tree and I like the starburst effect from the sun peeking around it.  I might like a different angle better (like wide angle from the base of the tree), although I don''t know that it would better illustrate the challenge concept.', '2008-02-22 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506623, 648967, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great reflection in the water</td>', 'Great reflection in the water', '2008-02-22 09:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506626, 648839, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice image</td>', 'Nice image', '2008-02-22 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506629, 648285, 89341, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too dark for my liking</td>', 'It''s a little too dark for my liking', '2008-02-22 09:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506630, 648765, 65234, '<td valign="top">Did it fall down?  Bummer.  Makes for a nice angled composition, though personally I like reading old gravestones.  Much more interesting than a name and dates ... more personal than most of today''s markers.</td>', 'Did it fall down?  Bummer.  Makes for a nice angled composition, though personally I like reading old gravestones.  Much more interesting than a name and dates ... more personal than most of today''s markers.', '2008-02-22 09:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506631, 649044, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute :-)  Like the blues against the brick and the reflections in the TV.</td>', 'Cute :-)  Like the blues against the brick and the reflections in the TV.', '2008-02-22 09:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506634, 648961, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset and I love the fine detail of the silhouetted trees.  Very soothing view, indeed.</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset and I love the fine detail of the silhouetted trees.  Very soothing view, indeed.', '2008-02-22 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506636, 648727, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I think it could be improved very slightly using the unsharp mask to sharpen the reflection a bit</td>', 'Nice picture, I think it could be improved very slightly using the unsharp mask to sharpen the reflection a bit', '2008-02-22 09:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506637, 648611, 89341, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, the birds give a nice little extra to the image</td>', 'Very nice image, the birds give a nice little extra to the image', '2008-02-22 09:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506639, 647721, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Teeny bit overexposed, but I like the composition in an abstract way.  It''s hard to think of a spiderweb as peaceful, though, when it''s waiting to ensnare some poor, unsuspecting insect.  A temporary peace while unoccupied, I guess.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Teeny bit overexposed, but I like the composition in an abstract way.  It''s hard to think of a spiderweb as peaceful, though, when it''s waiting to ensnare some poor, unsuspecting insect.  A temporary peace while unoccupied, I guess.', '2008-02-22 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506646, 648923, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I think the masking tape needs to be a little neater IMO</td>', 'I like the idea, I think the masking tape needs to be a little neater IMO', '2008-02-22 09:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506656, 648868, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but really needs better focusing</td>', 'Nice idea but really needs better focusing', '2008-02-22 09:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506660, 648739, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of two very different-looking people, although their body language says one is clearly more relaxed than the other.  I can''t decide if the empty chair feels inviting or not ... it''s very close to the tenser guy ... guess I feel like I''d need to ask permission before sitting down.</td>', 'Nice catch of two very different-looking people, although their body language says one is clearly more relaxed than the other.  I can''t decide if the empty chair feels inviting or not ... it''s very close to the tenser guy ... guess I feel like I''d need to ask permission before sitting down.', '2008-02-22 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506663, 648978, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the contrasting black and whites</td>', 'Nice image, I like the contrasting black and whites', '2008-02-22 09:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506664, 648618, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty blues and I like the motion of the water going out in the foreground.  Surf looks a bit rough to be peaceful, though watching it could be, I guess.</td>', 'Pretty blues and I like the motion of the water going out in the foreground.  Surf looks a bit rough to be peaceful, though watching it could be, I guess.', '2008-02-22 09:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506668, 648890, 89341, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not really sure about that at all.</td>', 'Hmmm, not really sure about that at all.', '2008-02-22 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506669, 648880, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Not quite sure how it relates to peace except that dolphins are more or less peaceful creatures, assuming you are not a small, tasty fish.</td>', 'Cool shot!  Not quite sure how it relates to peace except that dolphins are more or less peaceful creatures, assuming you are not a small, tasty fish.', '2008-02-22 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506673, 647790, 89341, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting</td>', 'Very nice lighting', '2008-02-22 09:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
