(4506685, 648409, 65234, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this in the challenge context without the title I thought first of words associated with trumpets, like "blare."  I think with a slightly different angle, shallower DOF, and more light and focus on the face, my perception would change and I would immediately see what the title tells me.  IMO.</td>', 'When I first looked at this in the challenge context without the title I thought first of words associated with trumpets, like "blare."  I think with a slightly different angle, shallower DOF, and more light and focus on the face, my perception would change and I would immediately see what the title tells me.  IMO.', '2008-02-22 09:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506690, 648833, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s depressing :-(  Poor thing looks like it''s still grasping at a chance at life.</td>', 'Well, that''s depressing :-(  Poor thing looks like it''s still grasping at a chance at life.', '2008-02-22 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506698, 648680, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, she looks more worried than peaceful to me with the wrinkle in her brow and the tense steeple made by her hands, and the lighting makes it look almost like she has a black eye.  This image does look to me like it has a story behind it, but not a peaceful one.</td>', 'I don''t know, she looks more worried than peaceful to me with the wrinkle in her brow and the tense steeple made by her hands, and the lighting makes it look almost like she has a black eye.  This image does look to me like it has a story behind it, but not a peaceful one.', '2008-02-22 09:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506708, 648692, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to focus on the paint, which IMO looks almost angry with the bright primary colors furiously overlapping one another every which way.  The OOF peace symbol made by the hand doesn''t manage to overcome that feeling for me despite being a large part of the foreground.</td>', 'Interesting choice to focus on the paint, which IMO looks almost angry with the bright primary colors furiously overlapping one another every which way.  The OOF peace symbol made by the hand doesn''t manage to overcome that feeling for me despite being a large part of the foreground.', '2008-02-22 09:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506711, 648518, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the soothing deep blue of this, marred only by the little bits of purple on the jellyfish body.  saturation issue?  Or maybe an incomplete hue shift?  Anyway, this is largely a peaceful image.  Would like a tiny bit of headroom for the jeallyfish at the top if you could have managed it.</td>', 'I like the soothing deep blue of this, marred only by the little bits of purple on the jellyfish body.  saturation issue?  Or maybe an incomplete hue shift?  Anyway, this is largely a peaceful image.  Would like a tiny bit of headroom for the jeallyfish at the top if you could have managed it.', '2008-02-22 09:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506715, 647210, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is just too darn adorable!!  A stretch for the challenge, possibly, but I''ll buy it.  Nice composition with that green leaf diagonal leading to the little frog, and the leaves arching over them.</td>', 'This is just too darn adorable!!  A stretch for the challenge, possibly, but I''ll buy it.  Nice composition with that green leaf diagonal leading to the little frog, and the leaves arching over them.', '2008-02-22 09:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506720, 648590, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice image.  A family stroll to the waterfront.  Definitely a peaceful moment in the midst of a presumably busy city.</td>', 'That''s a nice image.  A family stroll to the waterfront.  Definitely a peaceful moment in the midst of a presumably busy city.', '2008-02-22 09:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506725, 648673, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice color on the flowers, and the one seems to be caressing the others on the left.  Compositionally, I would prefer the one on the far right cropped out and a little more left in the shot on the bottom.</td>', 'Nice color on the flowers, and the one seems to be caressing the others on the left.  Compositionally, I would prefer the one on the far right cropped out and a little more left in the shot on the bottom.', '2008-02-22 09:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506736, 647395, 65234, '<td valign="top">To me, blood and death do not equal peace, even if the bird has gone on to his eternal rest.  This particular image conveys violence with all the blood, and the selective desat just emphasizes the gore.  I feel much more uncomfortable than peaceful gazing at it.  Technically it is an effective image; I just don''t find that it meets the challenge topic at all for me.</td>', 'To me, blood and death do not equal peace, even if the bird has gone on to his eternal rest.  This particular image conveys violence with all the blood, and the selective desat just emphasizes the gore.  I feel much more uncomfortable than peaceful gazing at it.  Technically it is an effective image; I just don''t find that it meets the challenge topic at all for me.', '2008-02-22 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4506757, 649009, 65234, '<td valign="top">Eww; slugs.  Doing a Yin/Yang symbol, sorta''.  They''re certainly not destroying plants in my garden so I guess this qualifies as peaceful ;-)</td>', 'Eww; slugs.  Doing a Yin/Yang symbol, sorta''.  They''re certainly not destroying plants in my garden so I guess this qualifies as peaceful ;-)', '2008-02-22 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
