(4506763, 648901, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pastels.  A bit more black foreground than I would like to see; I''d crop much tighter (which would also eliminate the bright white parts of the sky).</td>', 'Nice pastels.  A bit more black foreground than I would like to see; I''d crop much tighter (which would also eliminate the bright white parts of the sky).', '2008-02-22 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
