(4507507, 648346, 38477, '<td valign="top">The details are lost mainly because of the image size (long and short). I don''t know if its mist or an artifact bang in the middle of the frame, but it is distracting. Overall a nice capture of a symmetric reflection. :)</td>', 'The details are lost mainly because of the image size (long and short). I don''t know if its mist or an artifact bang in the middle of the frame, but it is distracting. Overall a nice capture of a symmetric reflection. :)', '2008-02-22 14:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
