(4509595, 647538, 76430, '<td valign="top">My first thought was I would have liked to see the shoes more symmetrical between the halves, but with the writing spaced differently the words are symmetrical.  You should have used the full 640 pixels.  The horizon appears to be slightly tilted based on the line near the top.  The focus is a little soft.  Maybe the title could have been "Love and Peace All-Star Style" to match the flow from left to right.</td>', 'My first thought was I would have liked to see the shoes more symmetrical between the halves, but with the writing spaced differently the words are symmetrical.  You should have used the full 640 pixels.  The horizon appears to be slightly tilted based on the line near the top.  The focus is a little soft.  Maybe the title could have been "Love and Peace All-Star Style" to match the flow from left to right.', '2008-02-23 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509597, 648797, 76430, '<td valign="top">Few people know the verse and most that don''t won''t be looking it up.  I think it would be better to have the verse rather than the reference here.  The rower is rowing out of the picture.  Rowing into the picture is usually better.  Teh sun and grass are placed well, so if you could have caught him/her around the 3 pronged grass it would have been perfect if there was enough separation to not look like the boat was getting skewered.</td>', 'Few people know the verse and most that don''t won''t be looking it up.  I think it would be better to have the verse rather than the reference here.  The rower is rowing out of the picture.  Rowing into the picture is usually better.  Teh sun and grass are placed well, so if you could have caught him/her around the 3 pronged grass it would have been perfect if there was enough separation to not look like the boat was getting skewered.', '2008-02-23 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4509600, 648618, 76430, '<td valign="top">As nice as the sand and sky are here the wide angle makes it hard to see the surf.  I think it would be better if you had sacrificed the negative space of the sand and sky and zoomed or cropped in more o the surf.</td>', 'As nice as the sand and sky are here the wide angle makes it hard to see the surf.  I think it would be better if you had sacrificed the negative space of the sand and sky and zoomed or cropped in more o the surf.', '2008-02-23 10:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
