(4510414, 648797, 89546, '<td valign="top">This shot is amazing. The ripples in the water, the person in the left corner, the reflection of the sunset in the water, to the sunset itself, which isn''t too overwhelming all add to this picture. The title also causes you to wonder, I looked it up myself to see what it was.</td>', 'This shot is amazing. The ripples in the water, the person in the left corner, the reflection of the sunset in the water, to the sunset itself, which isn''t too overwhelming all add to this picture. The title also causes you to wonder, I looked it up myself to see what it was.', '2008-02-23 16:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
