(4510489, 648871, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well I have to say that it takes something pretty special to make me gasp at a ''silky water'' shot at the moment but for me the fantastically sharp and beautifully coloured fern give this image that.  A simply wonderful addition.  Not quite sure that it screams peace at me but still a rock solid 8</td>', 'Well I have to say that it takes something pretty special to make me gasp at a ''silky water'' shot at the moment but for me the fantastically sharp and beautifully coloured fern give this image that.  A simply wonderful addition.  Not quite sure that it screams peace at me but still a rock solid 8', '2008-02-23 17:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
