(4510805, 648605, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t get anything that represents peace more than a dove! Nice comp, some more contrast would work, but that''s going to be tough with white on white and basic editing rules.</td>', 'Can''t get anything that represents peace more than a dove! Nice comp, some more contrast would work, but that''s going to be tough with white on white and basic editing rules.', '2008-02-23 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510816, 648923, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and the implementation is ok, but not great. DOF, lighting and contrast could''ve be a bit better and would have brought out some of the great texture of the tape.</td>', 'Interesting idea and the implementation is ok, but not great. DOF, lighting and contrast could''ve be a bit better and would have brought out some of the great texture of the tape.', '2008-02-23 20:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510826, 647928, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what sleepers refers to. I''m just not familiar with that term in the context you are using it. It''s a very nice image, though great colors, detail and it leads my eye quite nicely where is needs to go.</td>', 'I don''t understand what sleepers refers to. I''m just not familiar with that term in the context you are using it. It''s a very nice image, though great colors, detail and it leads my eye quite nicely where is needs to go.', '2008-02-23 20:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510829, 648146, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally think of a predator like an eagle as peaceful, but this does look peaceful and the eagle is often a symbol of the defense of peace...<br/> <br/>Nice background on this, too.</td>', 'I don''t normally think of a predator like an eagle as peaceful, but this does look peaceful and the eagle is often a symbol of the defense of peace... Nice background on this, too.', '2008-02-23 20:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510834, 648611, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a great image, but JPEG compression hurts it. Serious artifacts are clearly visible around the birds and clouds. No doubt other areas of your image have lost detail due to compression. Check your JPEG compression settings in your image editor. Your file size is only 27k and you could have used up to 150k for your entry.</td>', 'It''s a great image, but JPEG compression hurts it. Serious artifacts are clearly visible around the birds and clouds. No doubt other areas of your image have lost detail due to compression. Check your JPEG compression settings in your image editor. Your file size is only 27k and you could have used up to 150k for your entry.', '2008-02-23 20:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510837, 649009, 83313, '<td valign="top">Are these worms or larvae of some kind? I think it''s supposed to appear similar to a Yin-Yang... maybe. The image itself is a bit grainy, but the colors and detail are good. This one really made me stop and examine it. Hope you have some details in your notes box for me to see after the challenge.</td>', 'Are these worms or larvae of some kind? I think it''s supposed to appear similar to a Yin-Yang... maybe. The image itself is a bit grainy, but the colors and detail are good. This one really made me stop and examine it. Hope you have some details in your notes box for me to see after the challenge.', '2008-02-23 21:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510838, 648213, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little soft, I''m not quite sure what her tattoo is supposed to be.</td>', 'A little soft, I''m not quite sure what her tattoo is supposed to be.', '2008-02-23 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510845, 649029, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good sentiment. Colors and contrast could be a bit stronger and cropping to put the flag a little more off center would have improved the composition. Your JPEG compression settings are a little too heavy as well. I can see artifacts around a lot of the edges. Your file size is only 46k and you could have used up to a 150k file size for this challenge, which would have eliminated those visible artifacts.</td>', 'A good sentiment. Colors and contrast could be a bit stronger and cropping to put the flag a little more off center would have improved the composition. Your JPEG compression settings are a little too heavy as well. I can see artifacts around a lot of the edges. Your file size is only 46k and you could have used up to a 150k file size for this challenge, which would have eliminated those visible artifacts.', '2008-02-23 21:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510848, 647943, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hate to give an image of such a sweet baby a low vote, but this is really dim.</td>', 'Hate to give an image of such a sweet baby a low vote, but this is really dim.', '2008-02-23 21:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510852, 648320, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does look relaxing, though I''ll be the stone bench got cold after a bit. I''m not caring for the composition. It almost, but not quite there for me. Maybe a lower angle would have done it.</td>', 'Does look relaxing, though I''ll be the stone bench got cold after a bit. I''m not caring for the composition. It almost, but not quite there for me. Maybe a lower angle would have done it.', '2008-02-23 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510860, 648665, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awww, a big old cuddly-wuddly bear! Most definitely a beast at peace.</td>', 'Awww, a big old cuddly-wuddly bear! Most definitely a beast at peace.', '2008-02-23 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510866, 648108, 83313, '<td valign="top">An incredible view, but there does not seem to be any real composition and framing of this scene. The whole scene also seems slightly skewed, but that may be how this scene really was.</td>', 'An incredible view, but there does not seem to be any real composition and framing of this scene. The whole scene also seems slightly skewed, but that may be how this scene really was.', '2008-02-23 21:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510890, 648698, 83706, '<td valign="top">Has a laid back feeling, but IMHO does not hold interest :)</td>', 'Has a laid back feeling, but IMHO does not hold interest :)', '2008-02-23 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510893, 648797, 83706, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, give the end of the day feeling :)</td>', 'Nice composition, give the end of the day feeling :)', '2008-02-23 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510901, 648630, 83706, '<td valign="top">I like the way the rocks break the foreground and to one side, while the sea is calm, the waiting give a more anxious feeling than peaceful.</td>', 'I like the way the rocks break the foreground and to one side, while the sea is calm, the waiting give a more anxious feeling than peaceful.', '2008-02-23 21:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510919, 648940, 83706, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the blue/black tones and the black/blue border works good for me, the composition of the swans is a nice break to the foreground and balances the tree in the background very nicely,</td>', 'Nice, I like the blue/black tones and the black/blue border works good for me, the composition of the swans is a nice break to the foreground and balances the tree in the background very nicely,', '2008-02-23 21:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510923, 647014, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of like just a snapshot, though I can see some good effort to compose and frame the scene. Maybe it''s just a bit too busy for an element to really stand out.</td>', 'Seems kind of like just a snapshot, though I can see some good effort to compose and frame the scene. Maybe it''s just a bit too busy for an element to really stand out.', '2008-02-23 21:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510925, 648518, 83706, '<td valign="top">this guy could have been in leading lines also, just a nit, the cut top and bottom of the jellyfish.</td>', 'this guy could have been in leading lines also, just a nit, the cut top and bottom of the jellyfish.', '2008-02-23 21:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4510934, 648320, 83706, '<td valign="top">The colors look good, snow not blown which is good, but I can''t connect the peace here, looks way to cold and miserable for me to be peaceful :)</td>', 'The colors look good, snow not blown which is good, but I can''t connect the peace here, looks way to cold and miserable for me to be peaceful :)', '2008-02-23 22:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
