(4510978, 648605, 83706, '<td valign="top">Aptly fits the challenge, especially the all white, the light through the wings is nice, but the bird seems a bit soft IMO, hard to make out the details in the head area</td>', 'Aptly fits the challenge, especially the all white, the light through the wings is nice, but the bird seems a bit soft IMO, hard to make out the details in the head area', '2008-02-23 22:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
