(4511899, 648396, 76185, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette shot, comes together well although the figure is almost too dominant. I wonder what an option with him much smaller in the scene would be like?</td>', 'Good silhouette shot, comes together well although the figure is almost too dominant. I wonder what an option with him much smaller in the scene would be like?', '2008-02-24 11:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4511900, 648756, 76185, '<td valign="top">Nice use of long exposure, very abstract feel given the crop.</td>', 'Nice use of long exposure, very abstract feel given the crop.', '2008-02-24 11:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4512339, 648308, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and an impressibe full lotus by you subject.<br/> <br/>A couple of thoughts -<br/> <br/>1.  the focus seems to be slightly off which will no doubt mean it gets dinged in the voting<br/>2.  The clutter on the table (water bottles, pizza box etc, actually takes away from the tranquility of the subject).  It may have been better to go with a plainer backdrop and I would be interested what this would have looked like in B&amp;W<br/> <br/>Just my 2pence worth</td>', 'Lovely idea and an impressibe full lotus by you subject. A couple of thoughts - 1.  the focus seems to be slightly off which will no doubt mean it gets dinged in the voting2.  The clutter on the table (water bottles, pizza box etc, actually takes away from the tranquility of the subject).  It may have been better to go with a plainer backdrop and I would be interested what this would have looked like in B&W Just my 2pence worth', '2008-02-24 16:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4512347, 648973, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and I like the depth of field that you have used together with the gentle black and white conversion<br/> <br/>The curtains are a little busy and distracting, but if you were going to use these as a backdrop it might have been slightly better if you had cropped down a little to lose the point where the curtains and the ceiling meet<br/> <br/>Just a couple of thoughts for what they are worth</td>', 'Very nice composition and I like the depth of field that you have used together with the gentle black and white conversion The curtains are a little busy and distracting, but if you were going to use these as a backdrop it might have been slightly better if you had cropped down a little to lose the point where the curtains and the ceiling meet Just a couple of thoughts for what they are worth', '2008-02-24 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4512355, 648797, 68035, '<td valign="top"><i>"For I know the plans I have for you," declares the LORD, "plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future. </i> <br/> <br/>Interesting choice of quote for the illustration, not 100% sure that it works completely with the picture, how about Proverbs 34:14?<br/> <br/>Anyhoo back on subject...Very nicely composed and the loan oarsman does add a sense of feeling to the image.  There seems to be something right on the left hand border about 1/3rd of the way from the bottom which is distracting me way more than it should do and could possibly have been cropped<br/> <br/>Lovely sunset and reflection</td>', '"For I know the plans I have for you," declares the LORD, "plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.   Interesting choice of quote for the illustration, not 100% sure that it works completely with the picture, how about Proverbs 34:14? Anyhoo back on subject...Very nicely composed and the loan oarsman does add a sense of feeling to the image.  There seems to be something right on the left hand border about 1/3rd of the way from the bottom which is distracting me way more than it should do and could possibly have been cropped Lovely sunset and reflection', '2008-02-24 16:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4512357, 649009, 68035, '<td valign="top">Are they banana slugs?  If they are do you know if you lick them they make your tongue go numb (though why you would want to lick a slug is another matter)<br/> <br/>Love the yin and yang of this image, though possibly could have done with a slightly deeper dof</td>', 'Are they banana slugs?  If they are do you know if you lick them they make your tongue go numb (though why you would want to lick a slug is another matter) Love the yin and yang of this image, though possibly could have done with a slightly deeper dof', '2008-02-24 16:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
