(4513084, 646893, 83706, '<td valign="top">I like the effect and the statue does look very peaceful, but the cord is distracting and too much foreground perhaps a wider and shorter crop if it was possible :)</td>', 'I like the effect and the statue does look very peaceful, but the cord is distracting and too much foreground perhaps a wider and shorter crop if it was possible :)', '2008-02-24 22:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
