(4513108, 648700, 83706, '<td valign="top">looks like a very peaceful  sleep :) A few things don''t work for me, the pacifier on top of her head, the designs on the sheets are distracting and top left seems blown out, also her cut arms. Perhaps a sheet without design and a head and shoulder shot might help focus more on your subject :)</td>', 'looks like a very peaceful  sleep :) A few things don''t work for me, the pacifier on top of her head, the designs on the sheets are distracting and top left seems blown out, also her cut arms. Perhaps a sheet without design and a head and shoulder shot might help focus more on your subject :)', '2008-02-24 23:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4513112, 648804, 83706, '<td valign="top">I like the speckle detail on the stone, IMO the composition would be better if you had her looking into the frame and not out if it.</td>', 'I like the speckle detail on the stone, IMO the composition would be better if you had her looking into the frame and not out if it.', '2008-02-24 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
