(4515912, 648320, 76185, '<td valign="top">Like the idea here. I''d say the snow looks a bit "dirty" probably as it''s melting which lessens the effect a little but that''s obviously out of your control. The model draped in a glamorous long red dress would give another option here for a different mood.</td>', 'Like the idea here. I''d say the snow looks a bit "dirty" probably as it''s melting which lessens the effect a little but that''s obviously out of your control. The model draped in a glamorous long red dress would give another option here for a different mood.', '2008-02-25 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
