(4515922, 648181, 76185, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a pair of slippers would be better suited for this idea? If deliberate, not sure the grain/focus adds anything here.</td>', 'Perhaps a pair of slippers would be better suited for this idea? If deliberate, not sure the grain/focus adds anything here.', '2008-02-25 17:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
