(4516033, 646750, 76185, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot, washed out look and relaxed crop gives it an ethereal feel. Perhaps a little more light under the legs would soften the slight harshness of the shadow here, if you want to reveal more of what she is balanced on. Not sure how "peace"ful it is but certainly out of the norm.</td>', 'Unusual shot, washed out look and relaxed crop gives it an ethereal feel. Perhaps a little more light under the legs would soften the slight harshness of the shadow here, if you want to reveal more of what she is balanced on. Not sure how "peace"ful it is but certainly out of the norm.', '2008-02-25 18:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4516042, 647071, 76185, '<td valign="top">Nice enough portrait, however the slightly off vertical lines in the background throw the shot off a lot.</td>', 'Nice enough portrait, however the slightly off vertical lines in the background throw the shot off a lot.', '2008-02-25 18:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
