(4519515, 648786, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest and say that I do not totally understand the concept.  There''s probably a deeper meaning than what I am thinking.  But what I do love about this is that the hands are so prominent and almost in your face.  Excellent focus and lighting.  And I love how this looks in black and white.  This is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I''ll be honest and say that I do not totally understand the concept.  There''s probably a deeper meaning than what I am thinking.  But what I do love about this is that the hands are so prominent and almost in your face.  Excellent focus and lighting.  And I love how this looks in black and white.  This is a beautiful photo.', '2008-02-26 21:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519516, 647762, 67697, '<td valign="top">Simple and straightforward.  I love how the background color complements the metal of the cross.</td>', 'Simple and straightforward.  I love how the background color complements the metal of the cross.', '2008-02-26 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519520, 648665, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh what a sweet and peaceful moment.  I have to say tho, every time I go to the zoo, ALL the flippin animals are sleeping lol.  Never fails...  Love the sunlight on him too.  Although, I cannot believe that he thinks that rock is comfortable!</td>', 'Oh what a sweet and peaceful moment.  I have to say tho, every time I go to the zoo, ALL the flippin animals are sleeping lol.  Never fails...  Love the sunlight on him too.  Although, I cannot believe that he thinks that rock is comfortable!', '2008-02-26 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519522, 648739, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid!  It seems like a very friendly conversation going on.  Would love to know what they are talking about.</td>', 'This is a great candid!  It seems like a very friendly conversation going on.  Would love to know what they are talking about.', '2008-02-26 21:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519525, 648998, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is so cute.  I love the smushed face.  Now I''m feeling like I need a nap :)</td>', 'This is so cute.  I love the smushed face.  Now I''m feeling like I need a nap :)', '2008-02-26 21:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519532, 648756, 70896, '<td valign="top">Even though there''s something about this image that just doesnt seem right, I''m going to up my vote. It feels very surreal and I can see where you were going with it. Looking at it closer it feels like a dream! You get an 8 from me!</td>', 'Even though there''s something about this image that just doesnt seem right, I''m going to up my vote. It feels very surreal and I can see where you were going with it. Looking at it closer it feels like a dream! You get an 8 from me!', '2008-02-26 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4519535, 648709, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m not really into birding, but I have watched people who do it and I am AMAZED at all the stuff they know about the birds they are looking for.  PLUS, they all whisper - it''s like being at a golf match lol.  I find that going in search of nature shots is quite peaceful and relaxing, so I understand what you are saying here.  This is a beautiful catch - I know that it''s so darn hard to get a good shot of little birds.  I love seeing it''s beautiful colors too.</td>', 'I''m not really into birding, but I have watched people who do it and I am AMAZED at all the stuff they know about the birds they are looking for.  PLUS, they all whisper - it''s like being at a golf match lol.  I find that going in search of nature shots is quite peaceful and relaxing, so I understand what you are saying here.  This is a beautiful catch - I know that it''s so darn hard to get a good shot of little birds.  I love seeing it''s beautiful colors too.', '2008-02-26 21:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
