(4520659, 646936, 81669, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... 10 10''s, 10 9''s... my personal best to date. 16 out of 147. But it''s not so much about the judging and competition and numbers for me (I have to keep reminding myself) as in the experience and the learning. I suppose the numbers help give me a good indication as to whether I''m making some progress in my learning curve, though, so a valid process. Thanks for all the very nice comments -- and, yes, scores -- on this one! Peace!</td>', 'Hmmm... 10 10''s, 10 9''s... my personal best to date. 16 out of 147. But it''s not so much about the judging and competition and numbers for me (I have to keep reminding myself) as in the experience and the learning. I suppose the numbers help give me a good indication as to whether I''m making some progress in my learning curve, though, so a valid process. Thanks for all the very nice comments -- and, yes, scores -- on this one! Peace!', '2008-02-27 08:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4520669, 647210, 92, '<td valign="top">I''ll never understand how some people vote. There''s NO way this deserves the low votes it was given. <br/> <br/>This is amazing on so many "levels" haha<br/>You''ve grown into a top notch wonderful photographer. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon. Nice find ! Where was this taken ?</td>', 'I''ll never understand how some people vote. There''s NO way this deserves the low votes it was given.  This is amazing on so many "levels" hahaYou''ve grown into a top notch wonderful photographer. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon. Nice find ! Where was this taken ?', '2008-02-27 08:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
