(4521093, 646637, 65083, '<td valign="top">I like it and I got it.  Too many people just don''t get shots like this which IMHO is sad.</td>', 'I like it and I got it.  Too many people just don''t get shots like this which IMHO is sad.', '2008-02-27 09:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
