(4521320, 647210, 64929, '<td valign="top">Just incredible, Judi!  You''re my hero (no kidding!).  This is a 10 ++++ shot and such a remarkable capture.  The colors, the composition, just everything!  Bravo to you!<br/>~elizadeb~</td>', 'Just incredible, Judi!  You''re my hero (no kidding!).  This is a 10 ++++ shot and such a remarkable capture.  The colors, the composition, just everything!  Bravo to you!~elizadeb~', '2008-02-27 10:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4521333, 648251, 85849, '<td valign="top">My thanks go out to the few that got it.<br/> <br/>To everyone else... OK, now I''m amazed. Everything you complained about I did on purpose. I took the picture with the sun shining so dramatically so that it would look like the sky was opening up. I wanted the rays of light and yes I did have on a lens hood. I puposely lessened the contrast to give it a more spiritual appeal. I liked the street light since it amplified the idea that the church is in the city.</td>', 'My thanks go out to the few that got it. To everyone else... OK, now I''m amazed. Everything you complained about I did on purpose. I took the picture with the sun shining so dramatically so that it would look like the sky was opening up. I wanted the rays of light and yes I did have on a lens hood. I puposely lessened the contrast to give it a more spiritual appeal. I liked the street light since it amplified the idea that the church is in the city.', '2008-02-27 10:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4521397, 648940, 32767, '<td valign="top">"I see the crystal raindrops fall<br/>And the beauty of it all..."<br/> <br/>Nice. I think I need more swans in my life.</td>', '"I see the crystal raindrops fallAnd the beauty of it all..." Nice. I think I need more swans in my life.', '2008-02-27 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4521441, 648710, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, this is so drastically underrated that it boggles the mind. <br/> <br/>Great photo and excellent interp on the topic. <br/> <br/>I''m just reading some of your comments - how can you NOT connect this with peace?? I didn''t vote on this challenge, but to me it definitely says Peace.</td>', 'Well, this is so drastically underrated that it boggles the mind.  Great photo and excellent interp on the topic.  I''m just reading some of your comments - how can you NOT connect this with peace?? I didn''t vote on this challenge, but to me it definitely says Peace.', '2008-02-27 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 0),
