n the way to Jostedalsbreen. heatherd: Not Alaska, but Norway. :-) andersbs: Very much so! :) kmtregoe: I do agree with you on that. To everyone else who voted and commented: Thank you. ', '2008-02-27 11:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
