(4521753, 648940, 14986, '<td valign="top">Love the story and the photo turned out beautifully.  Very peaceful quality to it, and of course the blues are always appealing.  Glad to see your efforts pay off in a great way...not just with the ribbon, but with a wonderful photo in its own right.</td>', 'Love the story and the photo turned out beautifully.  Very peaceful quality to it, and of course the blues are always appealing.  Glad to see your efforts pay off in a great way...not just with the ribbon, but with a wonderful photo in its own right.', '2008-02-27 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
