(4522011, 647943, 57229, '<td valign="top">This picture is beautiful. Wide open to dpc mockery, for sure, but it has to be the way it is to be what it is.<br/> <br/>As usual, the ''I can''t see'' comments say at least as much about the eye and the beholder as they do the beheld.<br/> <br/>I wanna be reborn and go to sleeeeeep!</td>', 'This picture is beautiful. Wide open to dpc mockery, for sure, but it has to be the way it is to be what it is. As usual, the ''I can''t see'' comments say at least as much about the eye and the beholder as they do the beheld. I wanna be reborn and go to sleeeeeep!', '2008-02-27 12:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
