(4522335, 648146, 81342, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kv144553:</b></div><hr/><i> Eagles are fierce. It looks like it''s going to go hunt something in a brutal way any second now. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Eagles are not fierce.  They hunt for food like any other animal. And the peacefullness came from watching such a beautiful creature perch and stare into nothingness completely at peace.</td>', 'Originally posted by kv144553: Eagles are fierce. It looks like it''s going to go hunt something in a brutal way any second now.   Eagles are not fierce.  They hunt for food like any other animal. And the peacefullness came from watching such a beautiful creature perch and stare into nothingness completely at peace.', '2008-02-27 14:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522339, 648146, 81342, '<td valign="top">and thosen of you who voted a 1, when did you lose your minds?</td>', 'and thosen of you who voted a 1, when did you lose your minds?', '2008-02-27 14:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522352, 647014, 81783, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JT77:</b></div><hr/><i> i don''t know about this picture.  You took it from a view where anyone could see it.  There is no point of view. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What the heck are you talking about..... You don''t make any sense.</td>', 'Originally posted by JT77: i don''t know about this picture.  You took it from a view where anyone could see it.  There is no point of view.   What the heck are you talking about..... You don''t make any sense.', '2008-02-27 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
