(4522434, 648710, 7073, '<td valign="top">i got your meaning right away and i personally liked this one.  i feel maybe that if you have angled it differently and gotten the other 2 it would have done a lot better!</td>', 'i got your meaning right away and i personally liked this one.  i feel maybe that if you have angled it differently and gotten the other 2 it would have done a lot better!', '2008-02-27 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522443, 647210, 72070, '<td valign="top">a really emotive animal shot! great work and well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'a really emotive animal shot! great work and well deserved ribbon!', '2008-02-27 15:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522557, 647210, 75034, '<td valign="top">Judi, Judi, Judi. Your determined to make this as hard as possible for me to catch up aren''t you? I see where this is going, your going to build up a huge lead and then just coast for a while and see if I can catch up to you. Well let me be the first to tell you I will not be sucked in by your plan I''ll just continue to turn out the same old dribble and keep you guessing as to when I''ll pour it on and just blow your doors off. So there!!<br/> <br/>Now on to the real thing your shot. I really like the shades of green and the bokeh. It''s an all around great shot and very much deserves the ribbon you won. Great work as per usual.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Judi, Judi, Judi. Your determined to make this as hard as possible for me to catch up aren''t you? I see where this is going, your going to build up a huge lead and then just coast for a while and see if I can catch up to you. Well let me be the first to tell you I will not be sucked in by your plan I''ll just continue to turn out the same old dribble and keep you guessing as to when I''ll pour it on and just blow your doors off. So there!! Now on to the real thing your shot. I really like the shades of green and the bokeh. It''s an all around great shot and very much deserves the ribbon you won. Great work as per usual. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2008-02-27 15:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522572, 647210, 33352, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Judi, Another great shot.</td>', 'Congratulations Judi, Another great shot.', '2008-02-27 15:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4522583, 648940, 33352, '<td valign="top">This should give you <b>peace</b> of mind,congratulations.</td>', 'This should give you peace of mind,congratulations.', '2008-02-27 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
