(4525486, 648940, 69183, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but the story that goes with it is even better. I find shots are more memorable when the photographer takes puts some detailed comments in about how and why the shot was taken - you get an idea of the effort involved and appreciate the photo all the more.</td>', 'I like the photo, but the story that goes with it is even better. I find shots are more memorable when the photographer takes puts some detailed comments in about how and why the shot was taken - you get an idea of the effort involved and appreciate the photo all the more.', '2008-02-28 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
