(4679941, 647943, 23002, '<td valign="top">I have to comment that my lcd monitor is calibrated using a Spyder 3 pro, and the image is just barely visible.  I can see the highlight on the nose but have to stare to see anything else.  So I am guessing that those who are using an lcd monitor that is set to be too bright (and lots of lcd monitors are set to be too bright) can see it, but the rest can''t. :(<br/> <br/>I do wish it was a bit brighter so that I could see this image because it sounds wonderful. :)</td>', 'I have to comment that my lcd monitor is calibrated using a Spyder 3 pro, and the image is just barely visible.  I can see the highlight on the nose but have to stare to see anything else.  So I am guessing that those who are using an lcd monitor that is set to be too bright (and lots of lcd monitors are set to be too bright) can see it, but the rest can''t. :( I do wish it was a bit brighter so that I could see this image because it sounds wonderful. :)', '2008-05-04 20:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
